Package: bidichan
Version: @VERSION@
Depends:
Source: https://github.com/torkve/bidichan
License: see LICENSE file
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @ISIZE@
Maintainer: Vsevolod Velichko <torkvemada@sorokdva.net>
Description: bidirectional resumable transport over an HTTPS WebSocket.
 Port forwarding, HTTP/SOCKS5 proxy, L3 TUN and PTY shell channels over one
 authenticated, network-outage-surviving link. Console-configured via
 /opt/etc/bidichan/bidichan.conf and /opt/etc/init.d/S60bidichan.
